message: If you use CodeGent in your work or teaching, please cite it as below.
title: CodeGent
abstract: >-
  Agentic coding on a free ChatGPT account: a VS Code extension, a browser extension and a local hub
  that let ChatGPT read a GitHub repository, apply its file changes, check them and report back, step
  by step.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Mohammad Asadolahi
